#. type: Title ##
#, no-wrap
msgid "3. Run the quantum circuit using the Estimator V2 API {#3-run-the-quantum-circuit-using-the-estimator-v2-api}"
msgstr "3. Executar o circuito quântico usando a API Estimator V2 {#3-run-the-quantum-circuit-using-the-estimator-v2-api}"

#. type: Plain text
#, fuzzy, no-wrap
#| msgid ""
#| "<Admonition type=\"note\">\n"
#| "The following jobs use [Qiskit Runtime V2 primitives](/guides/v2-primitives). Both `SamplerV2` and `EstimatorV2` take one or more primitive unified blocs (PUBs) as the input. Each PUB is a tuple that contains one circuit and the data broadcasted to that circuit, which can be multiple observables and parameters. Each PUB returns a result.\n"
#| "</Admonition>\n"
msgid ""
"<Admonition type=\"note\">\n"
"The following jobs use IBM Quantum V2 primitives. Both `SamplerV2` and `EstimatorV2` take one or more primitive unified blocs (PUBs) as the input. Each PUB is a tuple that contains one circuit and the data broadcasted to that circuit, which can be multiple observables and parameters. Each PUB returns a result.\n"
"</Admonition>\n"
msgstr ""
"<Admonition type=\"note\">\n"
"Os jobs a seguir usam [primitivas V2 do Qiskit Runtime](/guides/v2-primitives). Tanto `SamplerV2` quanto `EstimatorV2` recebem um ou mais blocos unificados de primitivas (PUBs) como entrada. Cada PUB é uma tupla que contém um circuito e os dados transmitidos para esse circuito, que podem ser múltiplos observáveis e parâmetros. Cada PUB retorna um resultado.\n"
"</Admonition>\n"

